  "note": "Adopted 58.8 m overall follows the parish and historic street-to-cross account; restoration descriptions also quote a 25 m spire and can be read ambiguously, so intermediate heights are estimates. Published church length66 m/width24 m differ from the mapped 60.5 ×24.5 m hall and 70.9 m outer envelope including west porch and rear extension; the mapped plan is used. Current open metal spire is the March 2016 replacement, confirmed by a September 2017 exterior and the parish installation photo. Pre-2016 clad-spire images and interior-only photos were discarded. All stage splits, structural section sizes, traceries and rear elevations are estimated; no square/plaza, flags, lettering or logos. Geographic yaw baked once from mapped controls [[-61.0700582, 14.6041919], [-61.0697674, 14.6040392]]. Cityscape: not tested; Full 3D world: not tested.",
